{"id":70044,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70044"},"modified":"2026-10-28T09:35:29","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T08:35:29","slug":"metlife-madrid","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/metlife-madrid\/","title":{"rendered":"15KM MetLife Madrid 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">15KM MetLife Madrid 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>15KM MetLife Madrid 2027<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>28 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), com tiro de partida marcado para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o financeiro de <strong>Madrid, Espanha<\/strong>. Limitada a um m\u00e1ximo de <strong>10.000 corredores<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica de inverno afirmada no calend\u00e1rio europeu destaca-se pela dist\u00e2ncia interm\u00e9dia ideal de <strong>15 km<\/strong> \u2014 perfeita como teste competitivo de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o para as meias-maratonas e maratonas da primavera \u2014 aliando alto rendimento desportivo \u00e0 vertente solid\u00e1ria e cient\u00edfica promovida pela <strong>Fundaci\u00f3n Educaci\u00f3n Activa<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A partida instala-se no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Paseo de la Castellana<\/strong> (a 45 metros da Plaza de Cuzco, junto \u00e0s ruas Juan Hurtado de Mendoza e Francisco Gerv\u00e1s), levando o pelot\u00e3o pela Calle Bravo Murillo, Glorieta de Cuatro Caminos e regresso ao eixo monumental da Castellana e do <strong>Paseo de Recoletos<\/strong> at\u00e9 \u00e0s imedia\u00e7\u00f5es da <strong>Plaza de Cibeles<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado prossegue depois pela <strong>Plaza de Col\u00f3n<\/strong>, Calle G\u00e9nova, Glorieta de Bilbao, Calle Alberto Aguilera e Calle Princesa at\u00e9 Moncloa, descendo pelo arborizado <strong>Paseo de Camoens<\/strong> (Parque del Oeste), Avenida de Valladolid e Paseo de la Florida at\u00e9 cruzar a Puente del Rey rumo \u00e0 meta na ampla <strong>Explanada del Rey<\/strong> (Madrid R\u00edo).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela \u00e1rea de eventos da <strong>Sportlife Ib\u00e9rica SAU<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o institucional com o <strong>Ayuntamiento de Madrid<\/strong>, a prova segue as normas da RFEA, FMA, World Athletics e AIMS. Os atletas contam com partida organizada em 3 caix\u00f5es de ritmo (Caj\u00f3n 1 Elite\/Sub-elite sub 60 min, Caj\u00f3n 2 de 4'00\"\/km a 5'00\"\/km e Caj\u00f3n 3 acima de 5'00\"\/km), lebres oficiais para <strong>1h00, 1h10, 1h15, 1h20 e 1h30<\/strong>, abastecimentos aos km 5, km 10 e meta, servi\u00e7o de autocarro lan\u00e7adeira da meta para a partida, bengaleiro e medalha de finalista.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">28 de Fevereiro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Paseo de la Castellana, Madrid, Espanha<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); b